WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.100
Before you ship what an agent wrote, review it in Sheprd.

2
00:00:05.104 --> 00:00:09.924
Open Review Changes from the palette: every file the work touched.

3
00:00:09.925 --> 00:00:13.385
Each change sits beside the code it replaces.

4
00:00:13.629 --> 00:00:16.769
Click a line number to leave a note for the agent.

5
00:00:17.334 --> 00:00:21.194
Then mark the file viewed, and move on to the next.
